# Precomputed exact distributions, ~205 MB.  NOT published: no experiment, figure
# or table in the Letter reads them.  They are written by the code/generate_*.sh
# drivers, which are included, so anyone can regenerate what they need.  Shipping
# them would make every clone 200x larger for zero reproducible numbers.
# The data behind the Letter is results/, which is 1 MB and is published.
data/


